industrial or [ RDF ](/wiki/Refuse-derived_fuel "Refuse-derived fuel") ) must
meet strict emission standards, including those on [ nitrogen oxides
](/wiki/Nitrogen_oxide "Nitrogen oxide") (NO  x  ), [ sulphur dioxide
](/wiki/Sulphur_dioxide "Sulphur dioxide") (SO  2  ), [ heavy metals
[7]  [8]  Hence, modern incineration plants are vastly different from old
types, some of which neither recovered energy nor materials. Modern
incinerators reduce the volume of the original waste by 95-96 percent,
depending upon composition and degree of recovery of materials such as metals
from the ash for recycling.  [4]

